#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. Mix = the game's own TAA blended with DLAA / DLSS: calmer, a bit softer. "
"off = the game's own picture. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = puhtad servad mängu renderdussuuruses. DLSS = sama, ja suurendab, kui mängu Skaleerimine "
"on alla 100 %. Segu = mängu enda TAA segatuna DLAA / DLSS-iga: rahulikum, veidi pehmem. väljas = "
"mängu enda pilt. Salvestub kohe."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How much of the Mix is the game's TAA, 0 - 100 % in 10 % steps: more = calmer and softer, less = "
"sharper. Shown while Mode is Mix, or a split has a Mix side. No extra cost."
msgstr ""
"Kui suur osa segust on mängu TAA, 0 - 100 % 10 % sammuga: rohkem = rahulikum ja pehmem, vähem = "
"teravam. Näidatakse, kui Režiim on Segu või poolitusel on segu pool. Lisakulu pole."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your graphics card. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, a lighter Glass "
"and fence fix, mirrors without Track moving parts. low = also no Smooth mirrors, no Glass and "
"fence fix, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Eelseaded sinu graafikakaardile. kõrge = kõik sees (mudel 1). keskmine = mudel 2, kergem klaasi "
"ja aia parandus, peeglid ilma valikuta Jälgi liikuvaid osi. madal = ka ilma valikuta Siluda "
"peeglid, ilma klaasi ja aia paranduseta, VR ala 60 %. Ei muuda kunagi seadet, mille oled ise "
"määranud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, fewest trails "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = kõige rohkem detaile, teravaim tekst, umbes 1,6 korda rohkem GPU-d kui 2. 2 (E) = "
"tasakaalus, kõige vähem jälgi liikluse taga: alusta siit. 3 (F) = kõige rahulikum aedadel ja "
"juhtmetel, võib liikuvaid detaile ära määrida, sama hind kui 2. 4 (M) = kõige raskem (umbes 5 "
"korda), ainult lameda testideks."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the Glass and fence fix, the Light trail fix and "
"the DLAA area. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Pildikvaliteet: teritus, tekstuuri teravus, klaasi ja aia parandus, valgusjälje parandus ja DLAA "
"ala. Parem avab rühma, Vasak sulgeb selle; see on iga kord kinni, kui menüü avatakse."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Teritab pilti pärast DLAA-d, 0 (väljas) kuni 1.0. Tõsta, kui pilt on pehme; liiga suur annab "
"servadele heledaid sõrmuseid. Maksab umbes 0,1 ms; 0 jätab sammu vahele."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Teritamise ulatus, 1 kuni 4 px: väike = peen detail, suur = jämedamad servad. Muuda, kui teritus "
"on liiga peen või jäme; ekraanist suuremana joonistatud pilt, nagu VR-is, vajab üle 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Teravam tekst tekstuurides (liiklusmärgid, armatuurlaud, GPS). 0 = väljas; mida negatiivsem, seda "
"teravam, aga aedadel rohkem vilkumist; proovi -0,5 kuni -1, kui tekst on udune. Ei maksa peaaegu "
"midagi."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaves: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it if "
"grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Works only while Texture sharpness is not 0. "
"Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Sama traataedadele, rohule ja lehtedele: tõsta 0 poole, kui aiad vilguvad, langeta, kui muru "
"paistab pehme. sama = järgib ülemist rida. Toimib ainult siis, kui Tekstuuri teravus ei ole 0. Ei "
"maksa peaaegu midagi."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Wires, fences and windows are treated as the thing in front, not as what you see through them, so "
"they do not smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms "
"per eye."
msgstr ""
"Juhtmeid, aedu ja aknaid käsitletakse kui seda, mis on ees, mitte kui seda, mida nende tagant "
"näed, nii et need ei määrdu, kui liigud. Lülita välja, kui seal määrdumist ei näe: säästab 0,02 - "
"0,06 ms silma kohta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: the glows are "
"drawn fresh each frame instead of being blended with older frames. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp "
"glows flicker, 0 = off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Takistab tänavalaternate ja autotulede hõõgumisel jälje jätmist, kui liigud: hõõgumine "
"joonistatakse igal kaadril uuesti, mitte ei segata vanemate kaadritega. 25 % sammud; langeta, kui "
"laterna hõõgus vilgub, 0 = väljas. Maksab umbes 0,05 - 0,2 ms silma kohta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: DLAA saab ainult iga silma keskosa (20 kuni 100 %); serv jääb mängu pildiks. Vähenda, et "
"lubada raskemat mudelit või rohkem fps-i; 40 % maksab umbes 40 % mudelist. Seab ka garaaži / "
"peamenüü veoki."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kuidas DLAA käsitleb liikuvaid osi ja veoki peegleid. Parem avab rühma, vasak sulgeb; menüü "
"avamisel on see alati suletud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA follows each moving thing on its own (traffic, wheels, number plates), so it stays sharp and "
"leaves no trail. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: everything then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"DLAA jälgib iga liikuvat asja eraldi (liiklus, rattad, numbrimärgid), nii et pilt jääb terav ja "
"jälgi ei jää. Lülita välja ainult selleks, et säästa umbes 0,5 ms silma kohta, või testimiseks: "
"siis liigub kõik kaameraga kaasa ja liiklus määrdub."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Smooths the truck mirrors too, so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can leave "
"trails in the glass; the others follow each moving thing."
msgstr ""
"Silub ka veoauto peeglid, et need ei vilguks. 1 peegel = ainult suurim (peapeegel sinu kõrval). "
"kõik = iga peegel. kaamera = odavaim peegli kohta, liikuv liiklus võib klaasi jälgi jätta; teised "
"jälgivad iga liikuvat asja."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"sees = iga peegel saab DLAA iga 2. kaadri tagant ja vahepeal näitab oma viimast puhast pilti: "
"umbes pool peegli hinnast. Servad jäävad puhtaks; liikuv klaasis uueneb poole sagedusega. väljas "
"= iga peegel iga kaader."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate and CPU: CPU tuning, AMD cache cores, an FPS cap and Low delay (Reflex) for flat, an "
"FPS cap for VR. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kaadrisagedus ja CPU: CPU häälestus, AMD vahemälutuumad, FPS-piir ja Väike viivitus (Reflex) "
"lamedale, FPS-piir VR-ile. Parem avab rühma, Vasak sulgeb selle; see on iga kord kinni, kui menüü "
"avatakse."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together. Prefer fast cores: only Intel CPUs with P-cores and E-cores. Higher "
"priority and no Windows power saving for the game: every CPU, Intel and AMD. Helps when the CPU "
"is the limit; no cost. Separate in dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Kolm CPU lülitit koos. Eelista kiireid tuumi: ainult Inteli protsessorid P- ja E-tuumadega. "
"Kõrgem prioriteet ja ilma Windowsi energiasäästuta mängule: iga protsessor, Intel ja AMD. Aitab, "
"kui CPU on piiranguks; hinda pole. Eraldi failis dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, "
"cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D): keeps the game on the cores with the big 3D "
"V-Cache, which games like. Switches at once; off gives the game all cores back. Try it and "
"compare in a busy city. No cost."
msgstr ""
"AMD X3D protsessorid kahe tuumarühmaga (7950X3D, 9950X3D): hoiab mängu tuumadel suure 3D "
"V-Cache'iga, mida mängud armastavad. Mõjub kohe; väljas annab mängule kõik tuumad tagasi. Proovi "
"ja võrdle ametis linnas. Hinda pole."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Low delay (Reflex) on, the NVIDIA "
"driver does the limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Ainult lame. Hoiab mängu enamasti sellel kaadrisagedusel: ühtlane kaadriaeg, vähem kuumust ja "
"voolu. Pane see veidi alla selle, mida sinu arvuti ametis linnas suudab. Kui Väike viivitus "
"(Reflex) on sees, piirab NVIDIA draiver. väljas = piiri pole."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only (NVIDIA Reflex). On = the game's frames wait less before the graphics card "
"draws them: less delay between your steering and the picture when the card is the limit. Boost "
"also keeps the card's clocks up. Same fps; small cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult lame, ainult NVIDIA (NVIDIA Reflex). Sees = mängu kaadrid ootavad vähem, enne kui "
"graafikakaart need joonistab: väiksem viivitus roolimise ja pildi vahel, kui kaart on piiranguks. "
"Boost hoiab ka kaardi taktsagedused üleval. Samad fps; väike hind."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills in the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it "
"when the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR. pool = mäng joonistab iga 2. peakomplekti kaadri (72 Hz -> 36 fps), kolmandik = iga "
"3.; peakomplekti kaadrisujuvdus (ASW / Motion Smoothing) täidab ülejäänu ühtlase rütmiga. Kasuta, "
"kui fps kõigub. Lülitab Turbo välja, kuni see on sees."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering, skipping the hidden lens edges, and whether OFXR Bridge "
"/ VectorXR are found. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu "
"opens."
msgstr ""
"VR kiirendid: Turbo, foveated rendering, peidetud läätseservade vahelejätmine ja kas OFXR Bridge "
"/ VectorXR leitakse. Parem avab rühma, Vasak sulgeb selle; see on iga kord kinni, kui menüü "
"avatakse."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo switches off the headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). VR only. On = "
"the game stops waiting for the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy "
"cities, traffic). Turn it off if the picture judders."
msgstr ""
"Turbo lülitab välja peakomplekti kaadrisujuvduse (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). Ainult VR. Sees "
"= mäng lõpetab igal kaadril peakomplekti ootamise: rohkem fps ainult siis, kui CPU on piiranguks "
"(ametis linnad, liiklus). Lülita välja, kui pilt tõmbleb."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring gets one colour per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Terav keskosa, madalam detail serval (ainult NVIDIA RTX). Säästab GPU aega suure Scalingu korral. "
"Ainult VR. Välimine rõngas saab ühe värvi 2 x 2 piksli kohta; aiad, rohi ja lehed säilitavad "
"täieliku detaili. Lülita välja, kui serv paistab plokiline."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated rendering is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the "
"view sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Kui suur on Foveated renderingu terav keskosa, 10 - 100 % 5 % sammudega: suurem = rohkem pilti "
"terav, väiksem sääst; väiksem = suurem sääst, madalam detail algab keskmele lähemal. 80 % "
"(tasakaalus) on vaikimisi; 90 = lai, 65 = kitsas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What Foveated rendering makes coarser. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + lighting = "
"also the game's lighting, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for blocky light or "
"shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Mida Foveated rendering karedamaks teeb. stseen = ainult 3D-maailm (vaikimisi). stseen + valgus = "
"ka mängu valgustus, ainult päris serval: suurem sääst. Testi: otsi plokilisi valguse või varju "
"servi vaatevälja küljel."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated rendering is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Kui kare on Foveated renderingu välimine rõngas. Tavaline = 1 värv 2 x 2 piksli kohta "
"(vaikimisi). Tugev = 4 x 2 kohta, Max = 4 x 4 kohta: rohkem GPU sääst, plokilisemad servad. Parim "
"silmaseirega, kus sa ei vaata kunagi välimist rõngast."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated rendering follows your eyes on a headset with eye "
"tracking (for example Varjo); without it the centre stays in the middle of the lens. Needs "
"Foveated rendering on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Katseline. Foveated renderingu terav keskosa jälgib sinu silmi peakomplektil, millel on "
"silmaseire (näiteks Varjo); ilma selleta jääb keskosa läätse keskele. Foveated rendering peab "
"olema mängu käivitumisel sees, muidu on vaja taaskäivitust. Ei maksa peaaegu midagi."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR. Mäng jätab vahele läätse nurgad, mida sa ei näe (peakomplekt teatab need), joonistab "
"vähem pikslit: rohkem GPU varu, pilt jääb samaks. Esimene sisselülitus vajab mängu taaskäivitust. "
"Lülita välja, kui vaate serv paistab vale."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR kaadrigeneraator (djules75), eraldi allalaadimine "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). leitud = selle kiht on selles mängus laaditud ja mod laseb "
"selle töö läbi. Käivita selle tray-rakendus enne mängu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = OpenXR täiendus (DienerTech) (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, Depth, "
"kaadrigeneraator; leitud = selle kiht on mängus laaditud ja mod laseb selle töö läbi. Kasuta "
"ainult ühte Turbot (selle või modi oma)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the game's own VR UI floats (HUD, menus). The mod types the change into the game's console "
"for you; needs g_developer and g_console 1 in config.cfg. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Kus hõljub mängu enda VR UI (HUD, menüüd). Mod sisestab muudatuse sinu eest mängu konsooli; vajab "
"g_developer ja g_console 1 failis config.cfg. Parem avab rühma, vasak sulgeb."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's VR UI layouts the rows below move: driving (the HUD while driving) or menus "
"(the game's menu screens)."
msgstr ""
"Millist mängu VR UI paigutust allolevad read liigutavad: sõit (HUD sõidu ajal) või menüüd (mängu "
"menüüekraanid)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the game's VR UI: height, side, distance, tilt, turn, size or curve, in small steps. The "
"game gets each change about 0.4 s after your last press: the console opens and closes by itself."
msgstr ""
"Liigutab mängu VR UI-d: kõrgus, külg, kaugus, kalle, pööre, suurus või kumerus, väikeste "
"sammudega. Mäng saab iga muudatuse umbes 0,4 s pärast sinu viimast vajutust: konsool avaneb ja "
"sulgub ise."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Right: every value of both layouts back to what config.cfg had at the start (the game saves its "
"own values when it exits)."
msgstr ""
"Parem: kõik mõlema paigutuse väärtused tagasi sellele, mis config.cfg-s alguses oli (mäng "
"salvestab oma väärtused väljumisel)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR): fps, ms, "
"numbers only, each with or without a graph of recent frame times (spikes show red), or the graph "
"alone. Its GPU cost is measured. Save keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Väike reaalajas fps-i ja kaadriaja kast, ka siis, kui see menüü on suletud (lame ja VR): fps, ms, "
"ainult numbrid, kumbki graafikuga viimastest kaadriaegadest (tippud on punased) või ilma, või "
"ainult graafik. Selle GPU hind mõõdetakse. Salvesta jätab selle alles."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"FPS-kasti lukk, asukoht, suurus, värv, VR kaugus ja pööre. Parem avab rühma, vasak sulgeb; menüü "
"avamisel on see alati suletud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Liigutab fps-kasti külgsuunas, % ekraanist (VR fixed / attached: kraadid ümber sinu). Lame ja VR "
"jätavad oma asukoha meelde. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Liigutab fps-kasti üles / alla, % ekraanist (VR fixed / attached: kraadid, miinus = üles). Lame "
"ja VR jätavad oma asukoha meelde. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Teeb fps-kasti suuremaks või väiksemaks (0.2 .. 3.0). Tõsta, kui ei saa peakomplektis või suurel "
"ekraanil lugeda. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fps-kasti teksti värv: 20 värvi, igaühel kontuur, et see oleks igal pildil loetav (black on white "
"= tume tekst, valge kontuur). Lame ja VR. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fps-kasti heledus, 10 - 100 %: 100 = värv nagu on, madalam tuhmistab teksti (kontuur jääb) musta "
"poole. Kasuta näidiku vaigistamiseks öösel või peakomplektis. Lame ja VR. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kui läbipaistev on kogu fps-kast, 10 - 100 %: 100 = täiesti läbipaistmatu, madalam hajutab teksti "
"JA musta kontuuri koos, et tuhm kast ei muutuks mustaks plekiks. Lame ja VR. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far back the fps graph shows: 2 - 60 s. One bar per slice of time = its slowest frame, so you "
"see spikes. Green = on time, yellow = a bit slow, red = a hitch; the line = the headset rate / "
"FPS cap / your usual. Shown when FPS counter has a graph."
msgstr ""
"Kui kaugele tagasi fps-graafik näitab: 2 - 60 s. Üks tulp ajalõigu kohta = selle aeglaseim "
"kaader, nii näed tippe. Roheline = õigel ajal, kollane = veidi aeglane, punane = tõrge; joon = "
"peakomplekti sagedus / FPS-piir / sinu tavaline. Näidatakse, kui FPS-näidikul on graafik."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + Track "
"moving parts). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR. Jälgi pead = liigub peakomplektiga kaasa. Kinnitatud mänguruumi = üks koht su istme "
"ümber, ignoreerib kabiini kõikumist. Kinnitatud sõidukile = kinni kabiinis, kõigub sellega kaasa "
"(vajab DLAA + Jälgi liikuvaid osi). Hinda pole."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, Sõidukiga seotud. Sees = iga veok / auto jätab oma fps-kasti koha kabiinis, pöörde, "
"suuruse, värvi, heleduse ja teksti meelde (salvestub dlaa.ini-sse menüü sulgemisel). Väljas = üks "
"ühine komplekt kõigile sõidukitele. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, Sõidukiga seotud. Parem = mõõda kabiin uuesti (istu paigal, pargitud), kui kast on "
"valel kohal. Vasak = selle sõiduki kast vaikeseadele (koht, pööre, suurus, värv, tekst); teised "
"sõidukid jätavad omad. Kast on kabiiniga risti."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Pöörab fps-kasti vasakule / paremale, kraadides (+ = nägu "
"pöörab paremale). Kasuta kasti nurgutamiseks, kui see on küljel. 0 = nägu sinu poole. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Kallutab fps-kasti, kraadides (+ = ülaserv kaldub sinust "
"eemale, nagu lebaks armatuuril). 0 = nägu sinu poole. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Pöörab fps-kasti oma tasapinnas, kraadides (+ = päripäeva). 0 = "
"püsti. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Kui kaugel fps-kast hõljub, 0.30 - 3.00 m. See jääb vaates "
"samasuureks igal kaugusel; muutub ainult sügavus. Pane lähedale sügavusele, mida vaatad, et "
"lugeda ilma uuesti teravustamata. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Paneeli asukoht, suurus, sügavus, suund ja menüü klahvid. Parem avab rühma, vasak sulgeb; menüü "
"avamisel on see alati suletud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Liigutab paneeli külgsuunas, % ekraanist (VR fixed in cab: kraadid ümber istme). Lame ja VR "
"jätavad oma asukoha meelde. Kasuta, kui paneel katab vajaliku. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Liigutab paneeli üles / alla, % ekraanist (VR fixed in cab: kraadid, pluss = alla). Lame ja VR "
"jätavad oma asukoha meelde. Kasuta, kui paneel katab vajaliku. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Teeb paneeli suuremaks või väiksemaks. Tõsta, kui ei saa lugeda, vähenda, kui katab liiga palju. "
"Lame ja VR jätavad oma suuruse meelde. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR. Järgi pead = paneel liigub peakomplektiga. Kabiinis fikseeritud = jääb ühele kohale "
"istme ees, püsib vaadates ringi; X / Y / sügavus seavad selle koha (kraadid, meetrid). Vajab VR "
"kihti (vaikimisi). Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Kui kaugel paneel hõljub: meetrites (0.30 - 3.00) VR kihina, "
"vaikimisi; pikslites sissepoole nihkena silma kohta, kui menu_vr_layer = 0. Sama suurus igal "
"sügavusel. Muuda, kui paneeli vaatamine väsitab. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Sees = paneel pöördub su poole, kui liigutad selle küljele, "
"sama suurus igast nurgast (VR kihina, vaikimisi, ka peaga kaasa liikuv fps-kast); väljas = lame "
"pilt. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches for comparing: DLAA off, the game's own TAA mixed in or side by side, the wire fixes, "
"running DLAA earlier. Nothing here is needed for normal driving. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it."
msgstr ""
"Lülitid võrdlemiseks: DLAA väljas, mängu enda TAA sisse segatud või kõrvuti, juhtmeparandused, "
"DLAA varem. Midagi siit ei ole tavaliseks sõiduks vaja. Parem avab rühma, Vasak sulgeb selle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Lülitab kogu modi sisse või välja ja jätab režiimi meelde; väljas näitab mängu enda pilti "
"võrdluseks. Väljas säästab kõigi osade hinna korraga."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = the mod on the left, the game's own TAA on the right, to compare (Split line position, "
"Split: left | right). Replaces Mix while on. With the game's console on, the mod switches the "
"game's Anti-aliasing for you."
msgstr ""
"sees = mod vasakul, mängu enda TAA paremal, võrdlemiseks (Poolitusjoone asukoht, Poolitus: vasak "
"| parem). Asendab Segu, kuni on sees. Kui mängu konsool on sees, lülitab mod mängu antialiasingu "
"sinu eest ümber."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the split line is, 0 - 100 % of the width in 5 % steps: the mod's DLAA / DLSS on the left "
"of it, the game's TAA on the right. Used only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Kus poolitusjoon asub, 0 - 100 % laiusest 5 % sammuga: sellest vasakul modi DLAA / DLSS, paremal "
"mängu TAA. Kasutatakse ainult siis, kui Poolitus mängu TAA-ga on sees."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What the split shows on its two sides: DLAA | TAA (the mod left, the game's TAA right), Mix | TAA "
"or DLAA | Mix (Mix = the two blended at Mix amount). DLSS instead of DLAA when upscaling. Used "
"only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Mida poolitus oma kahel poolel näitab: DLAA | TAA (mod vasakul, mängu TAA paremal), segu | TAA "
"või DLAA | segu (segu = need kaks segatuna Segu hulga järgi). Skaleerimisel DLSS DLAA asemel. "
"Kasutatakse ainult siis, kui Poolitus mängu TAA-ga on sees."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires move correctly while you drive: their movement is spread over the whole thin line. on "
"= default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is soft for a moment when "
"you switch."
msgstr ""
"Peened juhtmed liiguvad sõidu ajal õigesti: nende liikumine jagatakse kogu peene joone peale. "
"sees = vaikimisi. väljas = ainult võrdlemiseks; lähedased juhtmed vilguvad rohkem. Pilt on "
"vahetamisel hetke pehme."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires count as in front on every pixel they touch, even where they cover only a sliver of "
"it. on = default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges such as leaves. off = only to compare; "
"near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Peened juhtmed loetakse ees olevaks igal pikslil, mida nad puudutavad, isegi kui nad katavad "
"sellest vaid ribakese. sees = vaikimisi. sees (ilma A2C) = ka läbipaistvatele servadele nagu "
"lehed. väljas = ainult võrdlemiseks; lähedased juhtmed vilguvad rohkem."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Katseline: joonistab kaugeid alla 1 piksli õhukesi juhtmeid 1 piksli joonena, et need ei katkeks "
"kriipsudeks. Vaikimisi väljas: kauged juhtmed võivad tunduda tumedamad või värelda rohkem. Proovi "
"ja võrdle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA runs before the game adds its glow and colour look, so lane paint, wires and "
"rails shimmer less. Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscaling or Windows HDR. Same "
"cost either way; takes about a second to switch."
msgstr ""
"Ainult lame: DLAA töötab enne, kui mäng lisab oma hõõgumise ja värvilooki, nii et teemarkeering, "
"juhtmed ja rööpad vilguvad vähem. Muuda ainult võrdlemiseks. Ei kasutata DLSS skaleerimise ega "
"Windows HDR-iga. Mõlemal juhul sama hind; vahetamine võtab umbes sekundi."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Bug report: press the capture key twice (or Capture now) where something looks wrong; the mod "
"writes one zip you attach to a GitHub issue. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Veaaruanne: vajuta salvestusklahvi kaks korda (või Salvesta nüüd) kohas, kus miski näeb vale "
"välja; mod kirjutab ühe zipi, mille lisad GitHubi issue külge. Parem avab rühma, Vasak sulgeb "
"selle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"One switch for the most complete report: log detail debug, rewind 2 s, capture Full. Off puts the "
"rows back as they were. Only this switch is saved; the forced values are never written to "
"dlaa.ini."
msgstr ""
"Üks lüliti kõige täielikuma aruande jaoks: logi detailsus debug, tagasikerimine 2 s, salvestus "
"Täielik. Väljas taastab read endiseks. Salvestatakse ainult see lüliti; sunnitud väärtusi ei "
"kirjutata kunagi faili dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics and timing "
"measurements (a little slower)."
msgstr ""
"Mis läheb faili dlaa_inject.log: väljas = mitte midagi; vead = ainult tõrked (vaikimisi); "
"hoiatused = + mööda läinud probleemid; info = + käivitus ja muudatused; silumine = + statistika "
"ja ajamõõtmised (veidi aeglasem)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Keeps the last 0.5 - 3 s of frames on the graphics card all the time, so the report shows the "
"moment BEFORE the key (+ what DLSS got for the last frames). Costs graphics memory (the MB in the "
"cost column) and a picture copy per frame. off = none."
msgstr ""
"Hoiab kogu aeg viimased 0,5 - 3 s kaadreid graafikakaardil, nii et aruanne näitab hetke ENNE "
"klahvi (+ mida DLSS viimaste kaadrite jaoks sai). Maksab graafikamälu (MB hinnaveerus) ja ühe "
"pildikoopia kaadri kohta. väljas = pole."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Quick = system info, logs, settings, your picture and DLAA off for a few frames (about 1 s). Full "
"= + what DLSS got per frame (colour, motion, depth) and A/B sets: motion view, motion off, jitter "
"only (about 2 - 4 s)."
msgstr ""
"Kiire = süsteemiinfo, logid, seaded, sinu pilt ja DLAA mõne kaadri jooksul väljas (umbes 1 s). "
"Täielik = + mida DLSS kaadri kohta sai (värv, liikumine, sügavus) ja A/B-komplektid: "
"liikumisvaade, liikumine väljas, ainult jitter (umbes 2 - 4 s)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The capture key. Press it TWICE within 1 s while driving where it goes wrong (the first press "
"only arms it: one short beep). Right opens the Hotkeys page on its line to change it."
msgstr ""
"Salvestusklahv. Vajuta seda KAKS korda 1 sekundi jooksul sõidu ajal, kus midagi valesti läheb "
"(esimene vajutus ainult valmistab ette: üks lühike piiks). Parem avab lehe Kiirklahvid selle "
"real, et seda muuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How many captures stay in the dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL: older ones (folder + zip) are "
"deleted when a new one is written. all = never delete."
msgstr ""
"Mitu salvestust jääb kausta dlaa_selftest DLL-i kõrval: vanemad (kaust + zip) kustutatakse, kui "
"kirjutatakse uus. kõik = ära kunagi kustuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Selle menüü keel. auto = mängu keel (vaikimisi); vasak / parem valib teise. Linux / Proton: "
"hiina, jaapani ja korea keel vajavad fonte, vt README. DLL-i kõrval olev lang\\<code>.po võidab, "
"sinu enda parandusteks. Salvestus jätab selle. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Selle menüü kõik kiirklahvid, rida toimingu kohta, klaviatuuri klahv ja kontrolleri nupp. Parem "
