#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%hs = capture now (the menu closes first). The zip (dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL) holds "
"system info, the mod's and the game's log, dlaa.ini, your picture and DLAA off; Full adds what "
"DLSS got and the A/B sets; rewind adds the moment before. Your user name and home folder are "
"removed. %ls"
msgstr ""
"%hs = salvesta nüüd (menüü sulgub enne). Zip (kaust dlaa_selftest DLL-i kõrval) sisaldab "
"süsteemiinfot, modi ja mängu logi, faili dlaa.ini, sinu pilti ja DLAA väljas; Täielik lisab "
"selle, mida DLSS sai, ja A/B-komplektid; tagasikerimine lisab hetke enne. Sinu kasutajanimi ja "
"kodukaust eemaldatakse. %ls"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The 5 keys that open and drive this menu: %hs opens / closes it (the value), %hs / %hs / %hs / "
"%hs move (Hotkey column). While the menu is open only these 5 are kept from the game. %hs: change "
"them on the Hotkeys page."
msgstr ""
"5 klahvi, mis avavad ja juhivad seda menüüd: %hs avab / sulgeb selle (väärtus), %hs / %hs / %hs / "
"%hs liigutavad (Kiirklahv veerg). Menüü avatuna hoitakse mängust ainult need 5. %hs: muuda neid "
"Kiirklahvide lehel."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Closes the menu; the 5 menu keys go back to the game. %hs does the same from any row."
msgstr "Sulgeb menüü; 5 menüü klahvi lähevad tagasi mängule. %hs teeb sama igalt realt."

